# Build-context excludes for images built FROM backend/ (see
# voice_service/Dockerfile header for the context contract).

# Tool caches
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.import_linter_cache

# Test suites never ship in images
**/tests/

# The notifier deploys as a Lambda package, not via this image
notifier/

# Docs and local environments
*.md
**/.venv
**/uv.lock
